---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Vishal Shivam - Software Engineer">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Bio Section - Left Side (2 columns) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          Hey, I am Vishal—a software engineer focused on distributed systems and data infrastructure.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          Currently, I’m a Senior Engineer at Bloomberg in London,
          where I work on data platforms—building S3-compatible storage systems
          and high-throughput data pipelines.

          I’ve also worked on Trade Order Management systems for FX and deposits
          (hard to resist trading systems when you’re at Bloomberg).
          I enjoy solving problems around scale, reliability, and system design.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          Previously, I worked at Informatica (now part of Salesforce),
          where I built a large-scale data classification engine,
          developed a DSL called Alchemist,
          and worked on column similarity problems at data lake scale.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          Outside of work, I spend time backpacking through Europe,
          reading tech blogs and research papers,
          experimenting with slightly questionable AI “skills,"
          and occasionally vibe-coding clones of popular apps—mostly to avoid
          paying for subscriptions.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          I’m active on
          <a href="https://github.com/shivamvishal" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">GitHub</a>
          and
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vishal-shivam" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          I enjoy learning about fun technical challenges and collaborating with great teams.
          <a href="mailto:vishalshivam007@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">Reach out</a>
          if you want to find a way to work together!
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Profile Photo - Right Side (1 column) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-1 flex justify-center">
        <div class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-gray-200">
          <img
            src="/images/vishal.jpg"
            alt="Vishal Shivam"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            style="transform: translateY(-10%) scale(1.2);"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
